  "name": "Monthly Surface Temperature, Humidity, Pressure and Upper-Level Heights for the Northern Hemisphere",
  "description": "Publication Title: Meteorologische abhandlungen = Meteorological proceedings. Translated sub-title: The yearly atmospheric circulation of the Northern Hemisphere. Contains the mean monthly changes of pressure, temperature, relative humidity, and precipitation together with the contour changes of the 500-, 300-, and 100-mb surface. Available from the NOAA Library System: URL http://www.lib.noaa.gov/.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This publication is in the National Climatic Data Center's Foreign Data Library, and is one of many books, atlases, maps, charts and other printed materials received by the NCDC from many nations over the years.",
